    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmic Companions is a &quot;cozy/life simulator&quot;, in which you are an astronaut traveling the vast and unknown universe to explore new worlds and befriending aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Find new and strange worlds, land with your dropship, and explore alien vegetation and animal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Make first contact with aliens, be social if you want to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Get funds from earth for creating a cosmic community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Use your funds for better engines that moves you quicker to the next planet, and more.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- It\u00b4s a game designed not to be played in one go, so set a course for the next world. It can take hours to reach it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmic Companions is a &quot;cozy/life simulator&quot;, in which you are an astronaut traveling the vast and unknown universe to explore new worlds and befriending aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Find new and strange worlds, land with your dropship, and explore alien vegetation and animal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Make first contact with aliens, be social if you want to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Get funds from earth for creating a cosmic community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Use your funds for better engines that moves you quicker to the next planet, and more.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- It\u00b4s a game designed not to be played in one go, so set a course for the next world. It can take hours to reach it.</p>",
